<title>ITALY: Italy records bop surplus in May.</title>
<headline>Italy records bop surplus in May.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's overall balance of payments recorded a 1.571 trillion lire surplus in May, the Italian Foreign Exchange Office said.</p>
<p>BALANCE OF PAYMENTS (In billions of lire)</p>
<p>			     May 97	 April 97    May 96</p>
<p> Total		     +1.571	  -2.144   +9.267</p>
<p>  -Year to date	  -1.058	  -2.675   +17.726</p>
<p> Capital movements     -3.018	  -4.343   +5.750</p>
<p>  -Year to date	  -76 bln	 +8.794   -11.919</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 678 2501</p>
</text>
